<title>FINLAND: Finnish November jobless rate up to 15.9 pct - SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish November jobless rate up to 15.9 pct - SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish unemployment rate rose to 15.9 pct in November from 15.3 percent in October and it fell 0.8 percentage points from November last year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>			 Nov 1996	Oct 1996	Nov 1995</p>
<p> Unemployed	   395,000	377,000	 409,000</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)  15.9	   15.3	    16.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The above figures are not seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>Finland's labour ministry, calculating on a different basis, earlier said the November unemployment rate rose to 17.4 percent from 17.3 percent in October.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
